# This repo is a write-up plus a live demo, not a full reproduction kit.
# Kept: the reports, the demo, all code, data/, the result JSONs that the demo
# and scripts/audit_*.py read, and the figures the docs embed.
# Left out: secrets and local config, private notes, model weights, backups,
# and raw run logs, which only matter for re-running the pipeline.

# --- secrets and local config ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.streamlit/secrets.toml
.claude/

# --- private working notes ---
personaldoc/

# --- python and tooling ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- model weights and training output ---
# Retrain with src/sft_warmup.py, src/grpo_train.py and src/classifier.py.
adapters/
checkpoints/
*.lora
*.safetensors
wandb/

# --- GPU smoke scripts that load the unpublished adapters/ ---
# pytest would collect them from a fresh clone and fail; the pure-logic tests
# (test_bon.py, test_qd_archive.py) stay.
test_grpo.py
test_dpo.py

# --- backups and superseded copies ---
*.bak
*.orig

# --- raw run logs and API caches (~45 MB) ---
# Every number in the reports comes from the analysis JSONs kept in results/;
# these are the per-rollout logs and judge caches those JSONs were built from.
# Scripts that rebuild an analysis from them will not run from a fresh clone.
results/**/*.jsonl
results/rubric_judge_cache.json

# --- generated duplicates and stale outputs ---
# The docs embed the PNGs; docs/diagrams/make_*.py regenerate the SVG sources.
docs/diagrams/*.svg
# Byte-identical copies of docs/diagrams/bon_*.png, written by scripts/bon_plot.py.
results/bon_curves.png
results/bon_efficiency.png
# src/plots.py output that predates the retraction in final_report.md §3.2.
results/comparison.png
results/headline_table.md

# --- logs ---
*.log

# --- editor and OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
